We add `UseRouting()` in the error branch. This requires a new overload to `UseRouting` since the current one replaces the `IEndpointRouteBuilder` [here](https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/blob/main/src/Http/Routing/src/Builder/EndpointRoutingApplicationBuilderExtensions.cs#L48): 

